    "title": "Tigers Bust Out Bats in Win at Waynesville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David ,\n1 days ago Nolan Lashley legged out an inside-the-park home run to cap a four-run second inning, and Preston McCracken went 3-for-4 with three stolen bases as Republic rolled past Waynesville 10-2 on Monday. The Tigers (5-7) scored in five of seven innings and never trailed after plating two runs in the first.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
